1
00:00:01,580 --> 00:00:03,520
麦克斯 卡洛琳 我有事情要宣布
Max, Caroline, I have announcement.

2
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:06,000
你是因为踩着高跷 才有这样的身高吗
You're actually much shorter and are walking on stilts?

3
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:08,840
我为明天的情人节晚餐
I have made a special menu

4
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:13,000
阿憨 真是浪漫啊
Han, that's so romantic.

5
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:14,720
没错 既浪漫又白目
Yeah, romantic and wrong.

6
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:16,640
这地方不是在演《当哈里遇见萨莉》
This place isn't When Harry met Sally.

7
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:18,060
而是"当哈里遇见沙门氏菌"
It's "When Harry met Salmonella."

8
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:21,740
麦克斯 总会三明治
Max, Club Sandwich.

9
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:24,040
先提醒你 我有个创可贴下落不明
And heads up... I lost a band-aid.

10
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:28,660
有主题菜单 我就能合理抬高价格
Theme menu means I can charge one bigger price,

11
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:29,920
就像高档餐厅那样
like in top restaurants.

12
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:31,636
看见没 "套子定价"
See? "Prick fix."

13
00:00:31,636 --> 00:00:34,140
阿憨呀 这个应该念"套餐定价"
Oh, Han, it's pronounced "prix fixe."

14
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:35,220
你瞧见咱们主厨了吗
Have you seen our chef?

15
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:36,840
铁定是念"套子定价"
It's definitely "prick fix."

16
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:39,400
明天晚上
Tomorrow night,

17
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:41,320
丘比特会飞来威廉斯堡餐馆哟
Cupid will come to Williamsburg diner.

18
00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:48,180
懒得告诉他其实丘比特早死了
Didn't have the heart to tell him Cupid is dead.

19
00:00:49,540 --> 00:00:50,680
没错 他在飞过高速公路时
Yep, hit by a mack truck

20
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:52,860
被一辆重型卡车撞得稀巴烂
crossing the Brooklyn-Queens expressway...

21
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:55,320
他那裹着尿布的婴儿肥臀
His fat, diapered baby ass

22
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:56,820
溅满整个挡风玻璃
splattered all over the windshield.

23
00:00:58,180 --> 00:01:00,280
我爱情人节
I love Valentine's Day.

24
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:03,080
你就这反应啊 姐杀了丘比特呢
That's your reaction? I killed Cupid.

25
00:01:03,560 --> 00:01:05,120
无论你有无浪漫情怀
You're either romantic or not.

26
00:01:05,120 --> 00:01:06,620
我都懒得花力气去说服你
I'm not even going to try to convince you.

27
00:01:06,680 --> 00:01:08,500
他的确死了 证据就是...
Oh, he's dead. And the proof...

28
00:01:08,940 --> 00:01:11,000
你上一次见人坠入爱河是什么时候
When's the last time you knew anyone who fell in love?

29
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:12,480
真爱哦 好比《冰冰爱可可》
Real love, like Ice Loves Coco.

30
00:01:13,860 --> 00:01:14,780
那他俩呢
How about them?

31
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:17,340
他们整晚都拉着手 浪漫地耳语
They've been holding hands and romantic whispering all night.

32
00:01:17,620 --> 00:01:19,720
他们的浪漫耳语其实是
Their romantic whispering goes like this.

33
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:21,640
"我有乳头夹"
"I own nipple clamps."

34
00:01:24,440 --> 00:01:26,300
咻 丘比特没死
Plink! Cupid's not dead.

35
00:01:26,300 --> 00:01:28,440
咻咻 爱神之箭飞射过去
Plink! There goes his little arrow.

36
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:29,580
咻咻咻
Plink, plink!

37
00:01:30,240 --> 00:01:32,340
我夹 哎呦 我夹 哎呦
Clamp, ouch! Clamp, ouch!

38
00:01:32,700 --> 00:01:34,620
我夹夹夹 我爽爽爽
Clamp, clamp! Ouch, ouch!

39
00:01:49,720 --> 00:01:52,460
麦克斯 既然十二点已过
Max, since it's just after midnight,

40
00:01:52,580 --> 00:01:54,680
现在就算是情人节啦
it's now officially Valentine's Day.

41
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:57,080
我这里给你准备了点东西 你猜是什么呀
I've got something in here for you... guess what it is.

42
00:01:57,440 --> 00:01:59,500
从你脸上的淫笑判断
Well, judging from that smile on your face,

43
00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:01,720
我猜是你的围裙里面有个手指宽的"洞"
I'd say it's a finger-sized hole in your apron.

44
00:02:04,660 --> 00:02:07,180
心型糖果 来 把手伸出来
Candy hearts! Here, hold out your hand.

45
00:02:07,380 --> 00:02:08,440
咱们来尝点甜头
Let's get our heart on.

46
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:11,620
我的"头"早就准备就绪
I'm way ahead of you.

47
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:18,060
"做我的爱人" 真经典 你的是什么
"Be mine"... classic. What's yours say?

48
00:02:18,820 --> 00:02:20,554
"卡洛琳·钱宁逊爆了
"Caroline Channing is lame.

49
00:02:20,554 --> 00:02:23,720
我讨厌你给我糖
"I hate you for giving me this.

50
00:02:23,720 --> 00:02:25,240
情人节去死吧"
Valentine's Day is the worst."

51
00:02:25,930 --> 00:02:27,240
哇 肉桂味的
Ooh, cinnamon. Mmm.

52
00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:34,620
晚上好 厄尔
Good evening, Earl.

53
00:02:35,200 --> 00:02:36,920
天啊 天啊 苏菲
My, my, my, Sophie,

54
00:02:37,300 --> 00:02:39,040
香衣配美人 我心跳加速难自持
seeing you in that dress makes my heart race.

55
00:02:39,360 --> 00:02:41,720
腰肢如竹子 胸前结椰子
Two scoops of ice cream in a one scoop cone.

56
00:02:43,700 --> 00:02:46,140
厄尔 你真会逗我开心
Oh, Earl, you make me smile.

57
00:02:46,580 --> 00:02:50,180
波兰要是能多点黑人就好了
I wish we had black people in Poland when I was growing up.

58
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:53,860
是很可惜 咱们黑人肯定会喜欢
Too bad. We really would have enjoyed

59
00:02:53,860 --> 00:02:55,440
种族隔离与希特勒呢
segregation and Hitler.

60
00:02:57,740 --> 00:03:00,060
你们好呀 邻居们
Oh, hi, building neighbors.

61
00:03:00,980 --> 00:03:04,320
我刚好开车经过 看到正在下雨
Well, I was just driving by, and since it was raining,

62
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:05,900
就想说用我的加长轿车
I thought I could offer you two girls

63
00:03:05,900 --> 00:03:07,640
送你们俩妹子回家
a ride home in my town car.

64
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:10,080
上次有人说要送我回家
The last time someone offered me a ride,

65
00:03:10,160 --> 00:03:12,040
结果我被扔进新泽西的下水道
I ended up in a drainage pipe in Jersey.

66
00:03:13,760 --> 00:03:14,740
苏菲 你租了辆加长轿车吗
Sophia, you rent a town car?

67
00:03:15,260 --> 00:03:17,480
对啊 不过只有在下雨的时候
Yes, but only when it's raining,

68
00:03:17,480 --> 00:03:20,680
你看 我去做了接发 接指甲
because, you know, I got hair extensions and nail extensions,

69
00:03:21,020 --> 00:03:24,280
所以我..."接着"就不屑走路了
and, you know, I... I'm too extended to walk.

70
00:03:27,700 --> 00:03:28,500
你好
Hello.

71
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:30,840
我从厨房里看见你
I saw you from kitchen.

72
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:33,840
你让上菜口变得如诗如画
You turned pick-up window into painting.

73
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:35,940
咻
Plink!

74
00:03:36,420 --> 00:03:38,820
吧台上的裸体绒画
Velvet painting of nude at counter.

75
00:03:40,660 --> 00:03:41,720
我夹 哎呦
Clamp, ouch!

76
00:03:45,320 --> 00:03:47,940
那俩姑娘说你有一家清洁公司
The girls tell me you own cleaning service.

77
00:03:48,140 --> 00:03:50,200
我想请你来打扫我家
I would like to hire you to clean my house.

78
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:52,260
没错 这个可以有
Oh, yeah, this is possible.

79
00:03:52,700 --> 00:03:55,020
我会叫个姑娘去 你的地址是哪里
I will send girl. What is your address?

80
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:56,440
我不要别的姑娘
I don't want some girl.

81
00:03:56,620 --> 00:03:58,060
我就要你来打扫
I want you to come clean.

82
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:01,360
想我来 你没那本事
Oh, you cannot get me to come.

83
00:04:08,500 --> 00:04:10,420
我当然有本事让你"来"[高潮]
Oh, I can get you to come.

84
00:04:12,980 --> 00:04:15,740
不可能 我不上门[来高潮]很久了
No, I can no longer come anymore.

85
00:04:18,780 --> 00:04:20,820
算了 麦克斯和卡洛琳可以来
No, Max and Caroline can come.

86
00:04:21,520 --> 00:04:22,940
不 不 我们才不来
No, no, we're not coming.

87
00:04:25,460 --> 00:04:28,120
所以没人能让你"来"[高潮]吗
So no one can get you to come?

88
00:04:29,740 --> 00:04:32,340
当然 有些人可以让我"来"
Well, some people can get me to come...

89
00:04:33,820 --> 00:04:35,460
但不是你
Just not you.

90
00:04:37,380 --> 00:04:39,660
傲娇难泡 我喜欢
Hard to get... I like it.

91
00:04:40,420 --> 00:04:41,940
你去拿外套 我去结账
Go get the coats. I'll get this check.

92
00:04:43,760 --> 00:04:45,240
这是最后一笔单子了 厄尔
Here's the last check, Earl.

93
00:04:45,540 --> 00:04:47,500
麦克斯 你能帮我入下帐吗
Oh, Max, can you take care of that for me, please?

94
00:04:47,660 --> 00:04:48,180
可以 为什么
Sure. Why?

95
00:04:48,620 --> 00:04:50,760
没什么急事 就是心脏病发而已
Uh, nothing pressing... Just having a heart attack.

96
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:51,560
明天见
I'll see you tomorrow.

97
00:04:52,700 --> 00:04:54,000
慢着 你心脏病发了
Wait, you're having a heart attack?

98
00:04:54,020 --> 00:04:54,960
确定肯定及一定
Most definitely.

99
00:04:55,280 --> 00:04:57,200
我这辈子病发过三次 跟老朋友一样熟
I've had three in my life. We're old friends.

100
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,720
厄尔 你可是心脏病病发呀
Earl, you're having a heart attack.

101
00:04:58,760 --> 00:05:01,020
没事的 你看见我的橘子了吗
I'll be fine. Have you seen my tangerine?

102
00:05:01,060 --> 00:05:03,620
我特意留个橘子 准备回家路上吃
I had a tangerine set aside for my walk home.

103
00:05:03,840 --> 00:05:05,060
别管那橘子了
Forget the tangerine.

104
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:06,560
厄尔心脏病发了
Earl's having a heart attack!

105
00:05:07,260 --> 00:05:09,480
苏菲 我们得用你的轿车送他去医院
Sophie, we're taking the town car to the hospital.

106
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:11,060
厄尔 你什么时候开始疼的
Earl, when did the pain start?

107
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:13,020
我看见穿裙子的苏菲时
When I saw Sophie in that dress.

108
00:05:18,660 --> 00:05:19,860
靠 不是吧
Oh, hell, no!

109
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:22,940
怎么这么多人排队 新iPhone出来了吗
Why is this line so long? Did the new iPhone come out?

110
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:24,580
咱们把他扶过去吧
Let's just get him over there.

111
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:26,620
麦克斯 你能把这些人弄走吗
Max, anything you can do to move this along?

112
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:29,420
走开 名人来了
Move! Celebrity coming through.

113
00:05:29,660 --> 00:05:31,380
摩根·弗里曼心脏病发了
Morgan Freeman having a heart attack.

114
00:05:33,320 --> 00:05:34,840
他心脏病发了
He is having a heart attack.

115
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:37,320
疼痛级别从一到十 你是几级
On a scale of one to ten, what's your pain?

116
00:05:37,320 --> 00:05:39,340
二级 我们只是刚好经过
Uh, two, we were just in the neighborhood,

117
00:05:39,340 --> 00:05:40,500
想找个地方吃果冻
looking for a place to have jell-o.

118
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:43,940
我是在问摩根·弗里曼说话
I was talking to Morgan Freeman.

119
00:05:44,940 --> 00:05:46,380
现在就治他
Take him now!

120
00:05:46,540 --> 00:05:48,420
先生 他有心脏病史
Sir, he has a history of heart trouble.

121
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:49,800
好吧 把他送进去
All right, we'll get him in.

122
00:05:50,420 --> 00:05:51,520
厄尔 跟护士去吧
Earl, go with the nurse.

123
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:54,240
靠 居然是男护士
Damn, it's a man.

124
00:05:55,700 --> 00:05:57,140
我们就在这等 厄尔
We'll be right out here, Earl.

125
00:05:57,180 --> 00:05:58,220
一定会没事的
Everything is gonna be okay.

126
00:05:58,560 --> 00:05:59,680
去那边坐着等吧
Have a seat and wait.

127
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:01,380
看着老娘 小弱鸡
Look at me, gingerbread.

128
00:06:02,160 --> 00:06:03,220
如果他有什么三长两短
If anything happens to him,

129
00:06:03,220 --> 00:06:05,440
我会用订书机 把你的阴囊钉在椅子上
I will staple your nut sack to that chair.

130
00:06:20,620 --> 00:06:22,200
没错 又是我
That's right... it's me again.

131
00:06:22,660 --> 00:06:24,480
都说过九遍了 他没事
For the tenth time, he's fine.

132
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:26,960
他只是轻微病发 也有人会妥善照顾
He had a minor attack, but he's in good hands.

133
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:29,460
请相信我 我在这里心脏病发过两次了
I would know... I had both of my heart attacks here.

134
00:06:30,200 --> 00:06:32,300
我得亲自进去看了才放心
I want to go back there and see for myself.

135
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:33,620
只准家属进去
Family members only.

136
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:36,240
-我是他的女儿 -真的吗
- Well, I'm his daughter. - Oh, really?

137
00:06:37,300 --> 00:06:39,680
病历上说他已经七十五岁了
It says here he's 75 years old...

138
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:41,120
他晚婚晚育
Well, he started late.

139
00:06:41,980 --> 00:06:43,480
还是个非裔美国人
And African-American.

140
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:45,380
他跟个白鬼晚婚晚育不行啊
He started late with a honky.

141
00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:46,620
我就是传说中的杂交婴儿
I'm one of those combo babies.

142
00:06:48,180 --> 00:06:48,700
给
Here...

143
00:06:49,160 --> 00:06:50,040
你不是要证据吗
You need proof?

144
00:06:50,740 --> 00:06:52,120
我姓布莱克[黑]
My last name is Black,

145
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:54,600
看见没 麦克斯·布莱克
see? Max Black.

146
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:56,040
他是黑人 我姓黑
He's black. I'm Black.

147
00:06:56,080 --> 00:06:57,340
如果我们俩不是亲人 才有鬼咧
It'd be dumb if we weren't related.

148
00:06:58,300 --> 00:07:00,220
我能继续玩"愤怒的小鸟"了吗
Can I just get back to playing Angry Birds?

149
00:07:01,420 --> 00:07:03,360
我此生挚爱在里面独自担惊受怕
You are yammering on here about nothing

150
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:05,960
而你除了会说废话 什么都不会
while the love of my life is back there alone and scared.

151
00:07:05,960 --> 00:07:07,420
你刚说他是你的父亲
You said he was your father.

152
00:07:07,540 --> 00:07:09,020
现在又成了你此生挚爱了
Now he's the love of your life?

153
00:07:10,020 --> 00:07:11,780
两者皆是 我们是狂野的南方人
He's both. We're from the South.

154
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:14,180
回去坐着吧
Have a seat.

155
00:07:16,840 --> 00:07:19,600
我为了买这两杯拿铁 等了好半天
I got us two lattes. It took forever.

156
00:07:19,760 --> 00:07:21,960
我前面那哥儿们 为了等一杯摩卡星冰
The guy in front of me missed his kidney transplant

157
00:07:21,960 --> 00:07:23,420
都错过了他的肾脏移植手术了
waiting for a mocha frappuccino.

158
00:07:23,900 --> 00:07:25,420
-有新消息了吗 -没有
- Any news? - The same.

159
00:07:25,420 --> 00:07:26,600
他们也不让我进去
But they won't let me back there.

160
00:07:26,700 --> 00:07:28,260
我甚至说厄尔是我父亲了
I even told him Earl was my father.

161
00:07:29,460 --> 00:07:31,860
机会来了 楚巴卡护士离开座位了
Now's my chance. Nurse Chewbacca's on the move.

162
00:07:32,260 --> 00:07:33,080
我要偷溜进去
I'm going back there.

163
00:07:33,080 --> 00:07:34,960
如果你发现有人注意到我
If you see anyone about to notice me sneak by,

164
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:36,320
就帮我把大家注意力都转移到你身上
draw all the attention to yourself.

165
00:07:36,540 --> 00:07:37,860
麦克斯 我不知道我是否做得来
Max, I don't know if I can do that.

166
00:07:38,500 --> 00:07:39,800
你说得对 这是我的专长
You're right. That's kind of my thing.

167
00:07:40,320 --> 00:07:42,380
-好的 我想想 -没时间想了
- Okay, let me think. - You don't have time to think.

168
00:07:42,400 --> 00:07:43,740
直接把咖啡扔墙上就行
Just throw the coffees against the wall.

169
00:07:44,020 --> 00:07:44,900
这太离谱了
That's ridiculous.

170
00:07:45,020 --> 00:07:46,840
我可是沃尔顿商学院的毕业尖子生
I graduated top of my class at Wharton.

171
00:07:46,880 --> 00:07:47,800
我的本事比这大多了
I can do better than that.

172
00:07:48,028 --> 00:07:52,540
呼叫本德尔医生 呼叫本德尔医生
Paging Dr. Bender. Paging Dr. Bender, please.

173
00:07:53,180 --> 00:07:54,320
天啊
Oh, my God!

174
00:07:58,660 --> 00:07:59,820
这咖啡居然不是脱脂的
Those were not nonfat.

175
00:08:08,500 --> 00:08:09,020
厄尔
Earl!

176
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:12,580
-你在里面吗 -麦克斯 是你吗
- You in here? - Max, is that you?

177
00:08:14,260 --> 00:08:15,460
你真好
Ain't you sweet?

178
00:08:15,580 --> 00:08:17,340
但你不必等着我了
But you didn't have to wait around for me.

179
00:08:17,780 --> 00:08:19,260
这位是小水仙
This is Narcissus.

180
00:08:19,640 --> 00:08:21,260
她来自斐济群岛
She's from the Fiji Islands

181
00:08:21,260 --> 00:08:23,740
刚刚帮我擦一个暴爽的澡
and gives one hell of a sponge bath.

182
00:08:24,900 --> 00:08:26,700
你好 能让我们单独说句话吗
Hi. Can we have a minute alone?

183
00:08:28,080 --> 00:08:30,640
厄尔 你觉得现在让人帮你"擦澡"合适吗
Earl, do you think this is a good time to have a sponge bath...

184
00:08:30,780 --> 00:08:31,600
就你这虚弱的小心肝
I mean, in your condition?

185
00:08:31,600 --> 00:08:33,380
麦克斯 当护士长这样时
Max, when they look like that,

186
00:08:33,460 --> 00:08:35,700
擦澡没有合不合适 只有爽不爽
there's never a bad time for a sponge bath.

187
00:08:36,880 --> 00:08:39,240
-那你现在没事咯 -好得很
- So are you doing okay now? - Pretty good.

188
00:08:39,540 --> 00:08:41,100
医生说这次是轻微的
The doctor said it was a mild one,

189
00:08:41,140 --> 00:08:42,880
但我得留院观察几个晚上
but I'm going to have to stay here a couple nights.

190
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:45,160
你能帮我问问自己住一间
Could you find out how much extra for me

191
00:08:45,160 --> 00:08:46,120
要加多少钱吗
to get my own room?

192
00:08:46,640 --> 00:08:47,700
单人房吗
A private room?

193
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:49,620
上次我睡在这种集体病房时
The last time I was in one of these places,

194
00:08:49,620 --> 00:08:51,880
我隔壁床的家伙以为自己是鹦鹉
the guy in the bed next to me thought he was a parrot

195
00:08:51,880 --> 00:08:55,100
整晚都在管我要饼干
and asked me for crackers the whole damn night.

196
00:08:55,980 --> 00:08:57,620
好的 我会给你找间单人间
Done. I'll get you your own room.

197
00:08:57,720 --> 00:08:59,160
别担心钱的问题
And don't worry about the expenses.

198
00:08:59,180 --> 00:09:01,320
我留有点钱 以备不时之需
I got a little money stashed away for a rainy day.

199
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:02,960
我才不用你的钱呢
I am not using your money.

200
00:09:03,300 --> 00:09:05,720
我猜"不时"指的是大麻的一种吧
But let me guess, "rainy day" is a strain of weed?

201
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:07,160
你果然懂我
Now you're getting it.

202
00:09:10,940 --> 00:09:11,780
晚点再来看你
I'll see you later.

203
00:09:12,740 --> 00:09:14,340
不许死 不然我杀了你
Don't die, or I'll kill you.

204
00:09:16,460 --> 00:09:18,740
你又闹哪样 现在又想要间单人房了
So what, now you want a private room?

205
00:09:18,900 --> 00:09:20,060
他怎么付得起钱呀
How's he going to pay for that?

206
00:09:20,280 --> 00:09:22,960
所以那个老人是全美国唯一一个
Oh, so that old man has to be the only man in America

207
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:24,300
得自己掏腰包付医疗费的人吗
who has to pay his medical bills?

208
00:09:25,440 --> 00:09:27,980
弗里曼先生演过很多成功的电影呢
Mr. Freeman's done a lot of successful movies.

209
00:09:28,860 --> 00:09:31,940
我觉得你这挖苦的态度太不专业了
I don't think your sarcastic attitude is very professional.

210
00:09:32,420 --> 00:09:32,820
"专业"
"Professional"?

211
00:09:33,460 --> 00:09:36,540
一个小时前 你的流氓朋友恐吓我说
Um, an hour ago, your little thug friend here

212
00:09:36,540 --> 00:09:39,140
要劈我一刀 把我劈出个阴道来
threatened to cut me so deep, I'd have a vagina.

213
00:09:42,280 --> 00:09:44,520
我说到 就敢做到
That offer still stands.

214
00:09:45,212 --> 00:09:48,769
她心情不好就会把阴道挂嘴边
She's upset. And vagina's her go-to.

215
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:51,400
我之所以没叫保安
Well, the only reason I haven't called security

216
00:09:51,400 --> 00:09:53,160
是因为他们两周前被炒鱿鱼了
is they were laid off two weeks ago.

217
00:09:53,860 --> 00:09:54,840
请问你的大名是
What is your name?

218
00:09:55,500 --> 00:09:55,940
缇格
Tig.

219
00:09:56,420 --> 00:09:58,200
是个假名 祝你好运
And it's fake, so good luck with that.

220
00:09:59,340 --> 00:10:00,380
先生 你可是代表着
Sir, you're representing

221
00:10:00,380 --> 00:10:02,520
薛柯特家族医院的形象
the Shecter family wing of this hospital.

222
00:10:02,900 --> 00:10:04,320
我们家族认识薛柯特家族
My family knows the Schecters.

223
00:10:04,580 --> 00:10:06,560
事实上 他们的儿子大卫也在这实习
In fact, their son David interns here,

224
00:10:06,580 --> 00:10:08,780
如果我给他打电话 他可会不高兴哦
and if I made a call, he would not be pleased.

225
00:10:09,040 --> 00:10:10,020
如果你认识他们
If you know them,

226
00:10:10,020 --> 00:10:12,480
咱们干嘛还跟前台的二货废话呀
why are we talking to this lump behind a desk?

227
00:10:13,340 --> 00:10:15,560
去死吧 红脸猪 我们要骑在你头上了
Suck it, red face! We're going over your head!

228
00:10:15,740 --> 00:10:17,300
现在是不是气得牙痒痒呀 贱人
How do you like me now, bitch?

229
00:10:19,820 --> 00:10:20,840
快打电话
Hey, get your phone.

230
00:10:20,940 --> 00:10:22,560
看看他能不能给厄尔安排间单人房
See if he can swing Earl a private room.

231
00:10:22,560 --> 00:10:24,360
我应该还有他的号码
I think I still have his cell number.

232
00:10:24,480 --> 00:10:26,540
我们约过几次会 后来我发现他真的
We went out a few times until I realized he was serious

233
00:10:26,540 --> 00:10:28,260
要走无偿服务那条路
about going down that pro Bono route.

234
00:10:28,740 --> 00:10:30,120
-你们俩睡了吗 -没
- Did you two have sex? - No.

235
00:10:30,680 --> 00:10:32,940
太棒了 人情债你可以肉偿了
Sweet, that's what you can offer him for the room.

236
00:10:36,700 --> 00:10:37,580
真厉害
That's amazing.

237
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:40,440
居然还有花店大半夜送花上门
Someone found a florist that delivers after midnight.

238
00:10:40,740 --> 00:10:41,920
这有什么厉害的
That's not so amazing.

239
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,760
我认识一个叫"粘得要死斯基"的家伙
I know a guy named "Sticky Icky" Ricky

240
00:10:43,760 --> 00:10:45,960
专门半夜送货上门
who delivers exclusively after midnight.

241
00:10:47,300 --> 00:10:49,840
我刚意识到这是我首个
You know, I just realized this is the first Valentine's Day

242
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:51,300
不会收到我父亲玫瑰的情人节
I won't get flowers from my father.

243
00:10:52,100 --> 00:10:54,640
又感人又带着一如既往的乱伦恶心
Aw, that's cute, with a big old side of creepy.

244
00:10:55,660 --> 00:10:56,880
不 多贴心呀
No, it's sweet.

245
00:10:57,040 --> 00:10:58,720
我出生后的每一年
Every year from the time I was a baby,

246
00:10:58,720 --> 00:11:00,200
即使当我有男朋友的时候
and even when I had boyfriends,

247
00:11:00,260 --> 00:11:03,040
我都会收到父亲送的玫瑰 卡片上写着
I'd get flowers from my father with a card that says,

248
00:11:03,260 --> 00:11:04,540
"你永远都是我的情人"
"You'll always be my Valentine."

249
00:11:04,920 --> 00:11:07,520
高中时 我收到过心仪对象的情人节卡片
I got a sweet Valentine from a guy I liked in high school.

250
00:11:07,840 --> 00:11:10,660
上面写着"把T恤拉起来 就给你五块钱"
It said, "I'll give you five bucks to lift your shirt."

251
00:11:13,780 --> 00:11:15,600
卡洛琳 我马上过来
Caroline... Hey, I'll be right with you.

252
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,980
他来了 比我记忆中帅多了
There he is. Cuter than I remember.

253
00:11:22,460 --> 00:11:24,520
我听到你的语音留言时 简直不敢相信
When I heard your voice mail, I couldn't believe it.

254
00:11:24,660 --> 00:11:26,720
我也不是很确定 你是否愿意来见我
Yes, well, I wasn't sure you'd want to come down,

255
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:28,920
因为...你懂的
because... you know...

256
00:11:28,920 --> 00:11:30,220
你两年前甩了我吗
You dumped me two years ago?

257
00:11:30,820 --> 00:11:32,660
"甩"这个词有点重吧
Well, "dumped" is a strong word.

258
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:35,360
当着我的面 把我的心撕成碎片扔掉
Tore my heart out, shook it in front of my face.

259
00:11:36,106 --> 00:11:37,566
这样有轻点吗
That any softer?

260
00:11:39,120 --> 00:11:41,520
抱歉打断你们"强颜欢笑假客套"的对话
Hate to interrupt the "perfect white teeth" convention,

261
00:11:41,520 --> 00:11:42,320
但我们赶时间
but we're in a hurry.

262
00:11:42,880 --> 00:11:44,240
大卫 这是我朋友麦克斯
David, this is my friend Max.

263
00:11:44,440 --> 00:11:45,740
我们的朋友入院了
A friend of ours was admitted,

264
00:11:45,740 --> 00:11:47,640
希望你能帮他安排间单人房
and we were hoping to get him a private room.

265
00:11:47,640 --> 00:11:49,380
所以你不是来还我
Oh, so you're not here to return

266
00:11:49,380 --> 00:11:51,020
你偷走的达特茅斯大学T恤的吗
my Dartmouth t-shirt you stole from me.

267
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:52,320
是你自己送我的
You gave that to me.

268
00:11:52,320 --> 00:11:53,960
才不是 我爱死那件T恤了
No, I didn't! I love that shirt.

269
00:11:54,280 --> 00:11:56,720
感觉就像我离婚时失去了孩子的监护权
I feel like I lost custody of it in a divorce,

270
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:58,220
而现在反倒成了不付赡养费的爸爸了
and now I'm like a deadbeat dad.

271
00:11:59,280 --> 00:12:00,700
那房间呢 能行吗
How about the room? Any chance?

272
00:12:00,820 --> 00:12:01,620
拜托 求求你了
Please. Pretty please.

273
00:12:02,100 --> 00:12:03,780
好吧 既然你都开口求我了
Oh, well, since you said "pretty please,"

274
00:12:03,780 --> 00:12:04,620
我看看我能做点什么
I'll see what I can do.

275
00:12:05,260 --> 00:12:07,100
先声明一点 我们没钱
We should be clear. We can't pay.

276
00:12:07,340 --> 00:12:09,660
我们破产了 我们俩都是
We're broke... both of us.

277
00:12:09,800 --> 00:12:11,340
但我相信有人跟你说了
But I'm sure you heard that somewhere.

278
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:12,160
是呀
Yeah...

279
00:12:12,260 --> 00:12:13,180
大家都在说
Everywhere.

280
00:12:14,820 --> 00:12:16,740
大卫 我希望我父亲没有造成
David, I hope your family didn't lose any money

281
00:12:16,740 --> 00:12:17,840
你们家族的任何损失 有吗
with my father. Did they?

282
00:12:18,140 --> 00:12:19,720
没有 我们仍旧富得流油
Nope, still filthy rich.

283
00:12:20,480 --> 00:12:23,362
我可以行行好 分点我家的油花给你
And I can do my best to burn some filthy off that rich,

284
00:12:23,362 --> 00:12:25,051
帮你朋友弄间贵宾房
by getting your friend a V.I.P. room.

285
00:12:25,300 --> 00:12:26,800
跟人报几个名字
I'll just drop some names.

286
00:12:27,060 --> 00:12:28,080
其实 是报我自己的名字
By that, I mean my own.

287
00:12:29,100 --> 00:12:29,860
应该就能搞定
Shouldn't be a problem.

288
00:12:30,600 --> 00:12:32,080
我爱犹太人
I love Jews.

289
00:12:34,340 --> 00:12:36,120
没错 我们慷慨大方 麻烦广而告之
Yeah, we're generous. Spread the word.

290
00:12:41,800 --> 00:12:44,860
可以的话 记得告诉小水仙我的去向
Uh, if you wouldn't mind giving Narcissus my whereabouts?

291
00:12:46,360 --> 00:12:49,400
我推你经过前台时 看见那二货
Did you see the look on that desk lump's big, red face

292
00:12:49,400 --> 00:12:50,480
他又肥又红的脸上的表情吗
when I pushed you by him?

293
00:12:50,680 --> 00:12:52,460
看见了 但我觉得对他伸中指
I did, but I think throwing him the finger

294
00:12:52,460 --> 00:12:54,000
有点小小的过分了哦
was a tad out of line.

295
00:12:56,340 --> 00:12:59,020
哇 大卫医生真是说到做到呀
Wow, Dr. David really hooked us up.

296
00:12:59,500 --> 00:13:03,100
是呀 感觉就像美剧里的重症监护病房一样
Yeah, this is like an episode of Cribs I.C.U. Edition.

297
00:13:03,620 --> 00:13:05,080
厄尔 你觉得怎么样
So, Earl, what do you think?

298
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:06,100
上帝呀 那是马蒂斯的作品吗
Good lord, is that a Matisse?

299
00:13:06,100 --> 00:13:09,340
-是吧 -亲娘咧 我到家了
- I believe so. - Then, mama, I'm home.

300
00:13:15,060 --> 00:13:17,160
给 女士们 把这俩棒棒糖放进你的围裙里
Here, ladies, put these suckers in your station.

301
00:13:17,420 --> 00:13:19,500
等会说不定有情人节夜的二次就餐高峰期
I think I might get a late Valentine dinner crowd.

302
00:13:19,820 --> 00:13:22,080
你还觉得你可能会迎来身高二次发育呢
You also think you might get a late growth spurt,

303
00:13:22,080 --> 00:13:23,220
但这两样都是不可能的
but that's not happening either.

304
00:13:24,620 --> 00:13:26,520
最多会有三个单身女人
At best, you'll get three single girls

305
00:13:26,520 --> 00:13:29,340
半夜踉跄地走进来 边痛哭流涕边吃木薯
waddling over at midnight to cry into some tapioca.

306
00:13:30,380 --> 00:13:32,400
的确 我还是别骗自己了
True. I need to cut the crap.

307
00:13:32,760 --> 00:13:34,060
情人节大餐梦破碎
Valentine's dinner is bust.

308
00:13:34,280 --> 00:13:37,540
瞧 我牺牲了我的男子气概 却无半点盈利
And look, I have sacrificed my manhood for no cash value.

309
00:13:39,280 --> 00:13:41,140
可你的翅膀好可爱哟
But your wings are adorable.

310
00:13:41,500 --> 00:13:44,280
没错 但成套的内裤让我的"小弟们"憋死了
Yes, but matching panties are suffocating the boys.

311
00:13:46,880 --> 00:13:48,520
好啦 早点关门得了
Come on, close early.

312
00:13:48,520 --> 00:13:50,040
我们只有一桌暮光脑残粉
We've only got one table of twi-hards.

313
00:13:50,660 --> 00:13:51,500
我想去看厄尔
I want to go see Earl.

314
00:13:52,420 --> 00:13:54,640
好吧 我也爱我的兄弟厄尔
Oh, what the hell? I love my man Earl, too.

315
00:13:54,820 --> 00:13:56,780
不管了 我们飞过去吧
So screw it. Let's fly over there.

316
00:14:01,240 --> 00:14:03,780
这里跟波兰的医院真不一样
Ooh, this isn't like the hospitals in Poland.

317
00:14:04,140 --> 00:14:05,500
灯居然都会亮耶
The lights are working.

318
00:14:06,620 --> 00:14:08,700
好了 坐下吧 我每次带一个人进去
Okay, sit down. I'll take you in one at a time.

319
00:14:09,340 --> 00:14:10,460
来 丘比特 你先来
All right, Cupid, you're first.

320
00:14:14,260 --> 00:14:16,120
别吵醒他 快出去
Oh, don't wake him. Go back out.

321
00:14:17,580 --> 00:14:19,640
天使 天啊 不要啊
Angels. Oh, lord, no.

322
00:14:21,580 --> 00:14:22,960
幸好是你 阿憨
Thank God it's you, Han.

323
00:14:23,440 --> 00:14:26,000
我刚看见翅膀 还以为天堂
I saw the wings, and I thought heaven was filled

324
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:29,140
全都是矮胖的中国天使 还没有爵士乐
with chunky Chinese cherubs and no jazz.

325
00:14:30,940 --> 00:14:33,060
好 太棒了 五分钟后见
Oh, okay, great. I'll see you in five.

326
00:14:33,860 --> 00:14:35,160
我约了大卫医生
I'm gonna go meet Dr. David.

327
00:14:35,540 --> 00:14:36,400
等下
Oh, wait a second.

328
00:14:36,900 --> 00:14:38,960
如果你要去见男人 你得来点唇彩
If you're going to go meet man, you need lip gloss.

329
00:14:39,100 --> 00:14:40,080
谢谢 苏菲
Oh, thanks, Sophie.

330
00:14:40,300 --> 00:14:42,020
别 别 别 好吧
Oh, no, no, no, no. Okay.

331
00:14:47,900 --> 00:14:50,780
我有份情人节礼物要送你
I have Valentine gift I want to give you.

332
00:14:51,640 --> 00:14:52,980
丙型肝炎吗
Oh, hepatitis "C"?

333
00:14:55,460 --> 00:14:56,480
情人节快乐
Happy Valentine's Day.

334
00:14:58,840 --> 00:15:02,320
看看我 再看看自己
Look at me. Now look at you.

335
00:15:03,180 --> 00:15:04,580
再来看看我
Now look at me again.

336
00:15:06,020 --> 00:15:07,940
你觉得合适吗 搭吗
Does this look right to you?

337
00:15:09,680 --> 00:15:11,980
傲娇难泡 我喜欢
Hard to get... I like it.

338
00:15:15,420 --> 00:15:17,397
你的朋友怎么样了
Oh, hey. So how's your friend doing?

339
00:15:17,397 --> 00:15:19,640
很好 贵宾房的事谢谢你
Good. And thanks for that V.I.P. room.

340
00:15:19,640 --> 00:15:22,140
他过得像个百万富翁 我相信得花不少钱吧
He feels like a million bucks, which I'm sure is what it costs,

341
00:15:22,220 --> 00:15:24,000
所以我给你带了份谢礼
so I brought you a little thank-you gift.

342
00:15:24,700 --> 00:15:26,580
这不是我的达特茅斯T恤
That is not my Dartmouth shirt.

343
00:15:26,860 --> 00:15:28,800
对 那件衣服还被关押在别墅里呢
No, that's held hostage at the townhouse.

344
00:15:28,940 --> 00:15:30,800
这件上面写着"威廉斯堡" 我现在住那里
This says Williamsburg. That's where I live now.

345
00:15:31,140 --> 00:15:32,340
不是吧 我也住那里
No way. That's where I live.

346
00:15:32,820 --> 00:15:34,580
我最初搬去那里是为了气我的父亲
Yeah, I moved there just to piss my father off,

347
00:15:34,580 --> 00:15:35,580
但我后来爱上了那里
but I wound up loving it.

348
00:15:35,740 --> 00:15:37,020
我后来也爱上了那里
I wound up loving it, too.

349
00:15:37,880 --> 00:15:40,000
我们有时间可以见个面...
Hey, maybe we could see each other there sometime...

350
00:15:40,240 --> 00:15:41,380
约个会什么的呀
You know, go out?

351
00:15:41,760 --> 00:15:43,040
别想了
Yeah, I don't think so.

352
00:15:43,920 --> 00:15:45,160
抱歉 你刚说什么
I'm sorry. I'm sorry, what?

353
00:15:48,020 --> 00:15:48,900
听着 卡洛琳
Look, Caroline,

354
00:15:48,900 --> 00:15:51,180
能重遇你真的很开心 但...
it's been really great getting to reconnect with you, but...

355
00:15:51,180 --> 00:15:53,460
我们之间爱火重燃是不可能的
I don't see this happening again.

356
00:15:55,320 --> 00:15:56,440
我父母肯定不同意
I mean, it's my parents.

357
00:15:57,120 --> 00:15:59,060
你父亲蹲大牢 丑闻满天飞
With your father in prison, the whole scandal,

358
00:15:59,800 --> 00:16:01,120
我永远也不能带你回家
I could never bring you home.

359
00:16:02,160 --> 00:16:03,700
当是气你父亲也不行吗
Not even just to piss off your father?

360
00:16:03,820 --> 00:16:06,040
我跟卡洛琳·钱宁约会
I mean, me dating Caroline Channing...

361
00:16:06,080 --> 00:16:07,000
人们会怎么想啊
What would people think?

362
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:08,540
希望你能明白我的难处
I hope you understand.

363
00:16:08,660 --> 00:16:09,440
对了 谢谢你的T恤
Oh, hey, thanks for the tee.

364
00:16:13,120 --> 00:16:14,940
大家都过来看我 真好
Nice of everyone to stop by.

365
00:16:15,080 --> 00:16:17,500
没看见卡洛琳 她今晚很忙吗
Didn't see Caroline. She busy tonight?

366
00:16:17,780 --> 00:16:18,820
没事 她就在这儿呢
Oh, no, she's here.

367
00:16:18,820 --> 00:16:20,160
她在外面忙乎
She's out there running around,

368
00:16:20,160 --> 00:16:22,956
想跟那个给咱们搞了间贵宾房的
trying to swing a boyfriend situation with her doctor friend

369
00:16:22,956 --> 00:16:25,220
那个医生朋友重燃爱火呢
who got us the V.I.P. hook-up.

370
00:16:25,220 --> 00:16:26,200
那你呢 麦克斯
What about you, Max?

371
00:16:26,660 --> 00:16:29,260
在情人节也没个情人
No sweetheart on Valentine's Day.

372
00:16:30,140 --> 00:16:31,360
我担心你
I worry about you.

373
00:16:31,600 --> 00:16:33,180
如果你有心仪对象 要对他好一点嘛
Be nice if you had someone special.

374
00:16:33,740 --> 00:16:35,020
现在不就是吗
I already do.

375
00:16:35,580 --> 00:16:39,520
麦克斯 我就只剩三四十年可以活了
Ah, Max, I'm only going to be around another 30 or 40 years.

376
00:16:40,460 --> 00:16:41,540
你最好把网撒大一点
You better widen the net a bit.

377
00:16:43,280 --> 00:16:45,260
探视时间到 友人请离开
Visiting hours are up. Friends have to leave.

378
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:46,900
她可以留下 她是家人
She can stay, nurse. She's family.

379
00:16:48,785 --> 00:16:50,340
厄尔 我是家人吗
Earl, I'm family?

380
00:16:50,340 --> 00:16:51,860
对 最好的那种家人
Yes, and the best kind of family.

381
00:16:51,900 --> 00:16:52,940
你不会图我的钱
You don't want my money.

382
00:16:55,480 --> 00:16:57,700
厄尔 你气色好多了
Hey, Earl. You look really good.

383
00:16:58,640 --> 00:17:02,018
你跟大卫医生有在医院的衣橱里开搞吗
So did you and Dr. Dave do it in a hospital closet?

384
00:17:02,018 --> 00:17:03,960
就跟《实习医生格雷》里的套路一样
All very "Grey's Monotony"?

385
00:17:03,960 --> 00:17:05,240
没有 我们不可能了
No, that won't be happening.

386
00:17:05,520 --> 00:17:07,620
我约他出去 他说他不可能跟我约会
I asked him out and he said he could never date me,

387
00:17:07,620 --> 00:17:10,640
因为我的父亲 还说"人们会怎么想"这种话
because of my father and quote "what would people think?"

388
00:17:11,160 --> 00:17:12,280
什么 你说什么
I'm sorry. I'm sorry, what?

389
00:17:12,960 --> 00:17:14,180
我感觉好像被撞死丘比特
I feel like I was just hit

390
00:17:14,180 --> 00:17:15,960
那辆重型卡车碾过一样
by the same mack truck that killed Cupid.

391
00:17:15,960 --> 00:17:18,479
现在有人真要被卡车撞了
Well, somebody's about to get hit by a truck...

392
00:17:18,479 --> 00:17:20,476
麦克斯超大型卡车
A Max truck.

393
00:17:24,291 --> 00:17:26,860
喂 就是你 我不记得你名字医生
Hey, you, Dr. I-Forget-Your-Name.

394
00:17:27,240 --> 00:17:28,820
怎么可能 我的名字随处可见
How? It's written on every wall.

395
00:17:29,960 --> 00:17:31,820
好吧 出口医生
Okay, Dr. Exit.

396
00:17:34,020 --> 00:17:35,420
你有什么毛病
What is wrong with you?

397
00:17:35,620 --> 00:17:37,020
医生不是都很善解人意的嘛
Doctors are supposed to be sensitive.

398
00:17:37,120 --> 00:17:39,400
今天是情人节 她一无所有
I mean, it's Valentine's Day, and she has nothing.

399
00:17:39,920 --> 00:17:41,600
你就不能像其他男人那样
Couldn't you be like every other guy on the planet

400
00:17:41,600 --> 00:17:44,440
先哄她上她 隔天再断绝联系吗
and just lead her on and not call her the next day?

401
00:17:44,620 --> 00:17:46,220
这才是得体的做法
That is the decent thing to do.

402
00:17:46,620 --> 00:17:49,960
顺便告诉你一声 心型糖果让她昏了头
And for the record, she is so hopped up on candy hearts,

403
00:17:49,980 --> 00:17:51,600
你今晚本可以尝到"甜头"的 真的
you would have gotten some tonight, fo' sho!

404
00:17:53,920 --> 00:17:56,160
你刚犯下了这辈子最大的错误
You just made the biggest mistake of your life.

405
00:17:57,520 --> 00:17:59,500
我猜你比任何人都了解我
Well, I guess nobody knows me better than you,

406
00:17:59,500 --> 00:18:00,680
这位素未谋面的姑娘
girl I've never met before.

407
00:18:02,420 --> 00:18:05,080
现在我想跟做无偿服务的那个你谈谈
And now I would like to speak to the pro bono part of you,

408
00:18:05,080 --> 00:18:06,684
他会理解我刚才说的话
who understands that nothing I just said

409
00:18:06,684 --> 00:18:08,380
不会去迁怒贵宾房里的那个人
should affect that man in the V.I.P. room.

410
00:18:08,380 --> 00:18:10,700
你帮我们安排病房的行为 的确很酷
That was actually a very cool thing to do.

411
00:18:10,960 --> 00:18:12,060
厄尔没事 别担心
Earl is fine. Don't worry.

412
00:18:12,120 --> 00:18:14,260
至于卡洛琳的部分 抱歉
And as far as Caroline goes, I'm sorry, but...

413
00:18:14,260 --> 00:18:16,380
可她的父亲伤害了很多人
Her father hurt a lot of people.

414
00:18:17,100 --> 00:18:19,300
善有善报 恶有恶报
Whatever you put out there comes back to you.

415
00:18:27,220 --> 00:18:27,880
又怎么了
What now...

416
00:18:28,020 --> 00:18:30,080
你又想恐吓我 要把我的乳头塞我嘴里吗
you gonna threaten to feed me my nipples again?

417
00:18:32,380 --> 00:18:32,940
不是
No.

418
00:18:33,940 --> 00:18:35,540
其实是因为刚才有人说
Actually, someone just said something

419
00:18:35,540 --> 00:18:37,580
善有善报 恶有恶报
about the things you do coming back to you,

420
00:18:37,580 --> 00:18:40,280
所以我决定应该放聪明点来跟你道歉
and I decided the smart move was to apologize.

421
00:18:40,920 --> 00:18:43,000
多谢 但没必要
Thanks, but it's not necessary.

422
00:18:43,920 --> 00:18:46,340
其实你是今晚我碰过对我最好的人了
Actually, you're the nicest person I've dealt with tonight.

423
00:18:49,140 --> 00:18:50,580
苦差事啊 伙计
Ugh. Rough job, dude.

424
00:18:50,800 --> 00:18:53,380
给 情人节快乐
Here, Happy Valentine's Day.

425
00:18:55,080 --> 00:18:56,540
你想找个时间出来坐坐吗
You want to go out sometime?

426
00:18:58,900 --> 00:18:59,940
我干嘛要...
Why would...

427
00:18:59,940 --> 00:19:01,960
好啊 号码给我 我明天打给你
Yeah, give me your number. I'll call you tomorrow.

428
00:19:09,220 --> 00:19:11,260
在医院的椅子上睡一整夜
Sleeping in that hospital chair all night

429
00:19:11,260 --> 00:19:12,240
也没那么难受嘛
wasn't that uncomfortable.

430
00:19:12,640 --> 00:19:13,940
对 椅子还好
No, the chairs weren't.

431
00:19:14,040 --> 00:19:16,300
让人难受的是 你的情人节啜泣
Your sad Valentine whimpering was.

432
00:19:17,560 --> 00:19:20,340
-你今天早上感觉好点了吗 -好多了
- So how you feeling this morning? - Pretty good,

433
00:19:20,420 --> 00:19:22,840
鉴于我撑过了没有父亲送花的
considering I survived the very first Valentine's Day

434
00:19:22,960 --> 00:19:24,340
第一个情人节
I didn't get flowers from my father.

435
00:19:26,600 --> 00:19:28,520
所以你度过了首个无爱的一年嘛
So you got one year under your belt.

436
00:19:28,580 --> 00:19:29,720
别太骄傲
Don't get so cocky.

437
00:19:30,020 --> 00:19:31,880
你还有二十三年才能追平我呢
You still have to make 23 more to tie me.

438
00:19:33,280 --> 00:19:36,640
一直以来 我都为你觉得惋惜
You know, all this time, I've been feeling sorry for you

439
00:19:36,720 --> 00:19:37,680
因为你不认识自己的父亲
'cause you didn't know your father,

440
00:19:38,100 --> 00:19:41,000
但看见你对厄尔悉心照料后
but after seeing how you took care of Earl...

441
00:19:41,780 --> 00:19:44,460
我为你父亲不认识自己的女儿而惋惜
I feel sorry for your father that he didn't know you.

442
00:19:45,220 --> 00:19:46,940
你会是一个好女儿
You would have been a wonderful daughter.

443
00:19:49,180 --> 00:19:50,420
千万别这么想
Don't hold that thought.

444
00:19:50,560 --> 00:19:53,040
没坐到木薯粉前 我可不哭
I don't want to cry till after we break open the tapioca.

445
00:19:59,320 --> 00:20:01,540
不是的 我没获得选美比赛冠军
No, I didn't just win a beauty contest.

446
00:20:03,440 --> 00:20:05,380
这些是我在前门楼梯上发现的
No, these were left on the front doorstep.

447
00:20:05,660 --> 00:20:07,280
都是送给卡洛琳的
They're both addressed to Caroline.

448
00:20:07,540 --> 00:20:09,360
-抱歉 麦克斯 -没关系
- Sorry, Max. - Oh, no, that's cool.

449
00:20:09,580 --> 00:20:11,260
这样我才能保持"连续无花记录"
Wouldn't want to break my winning streak.

450
00:20:11,740 --> 00:20:14,640
你可以这么想嘛
Oh, well, just look at it this way.

451
00:20:15,020 --> 00:20:17,600
花是她的 我是你的
She got the flowers. You got the knockers.

452
00:20:18,200 --> 00:20:21,600
好啦 姑娘们
All right, girls,

453
00:20:21,620 --> 00:20:23,380
我得去买痒痒挠了
well, I'm off to buy scratchers

454
00:20:23,380 --> 00:20:25,320
不然都被波多黎各人买走了
before all the Puerto Ricans get them.

455
00:20:29,340 --> 00:20:31,260
"你永远都是我的情人
"You'll always be my Valentine.

456
00:20:31,540 --> 00:20:32,340
爱你的爸爸"
Love, Daddy."

457
00:20:34,380 --> 00:20:35,880
另一束是大卫医生送的吗
The other one from Dr. Dave?

458
00:20:36,620 --> 00:20:38,360
在我撕碎他的心后 改变心意了吗
Change his mind after I tore him a new one?

459
00:20:38,800 --> 00:20:41,220
也是我父亲送的 不过是给你的
It's from my father as well, but it's written to you.

460
00:20:43,880 --> 00:20:46,640
"谢谢你对我的宝贝照顾有加
"Thank you for taking such good care of my sweetheart.

461
00:20:46,740 --> 00:20:47,440
马丁·钱宁"
M. Channing."

462
00:20:48,180 --> 00:20:49,620
真贴心
That is so sweet.

463
00:20:51,020 --> 00:20:51,820
男人送的玫瑰花
Roses from a man.

464
00:20:52,520 --> 00:20:54,160
现在我算懂了
Now I'm starting to get it.

465
00:20:55,020 --> 00:20:57,640
如果我说我想跟你老爸上床 会很怪吗
Is it weird that I kind of want to have sex with your dad?

466
00:21:02,640 --> 00:21:03,080
咻
Plink!
